OL,3,GUK weather for today and tomorrow
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FCloudy with
OL,6,Fshowers across Northern Ireland and
OL,7,FScotland, locally heavy with isolated
OL,8,Fthunderstorms, spreading
OL,9,Fsoutheastwards. Elsewhere, a hot and
OL,10,Fsunny evening then staying warm
OL,11,Fovernight with clear spells. Low cloud
OL,12,Fand coastal fog may develop towards
OL,13,Fthe southwest.
OL,14,
OL,15,CFriday:FStaying hot across much of
OL,16,FEngland and Wales before a weak cold
OL,17,Ffront brings cooler, cloudier weather
OL,18,Fin from the northwest. Isolated
OL,19,Fafternoon thunderstorms are possible
OL,20,Fin the east later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
